{"number":79,"nameArabic":"سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ","nameEnglish":"An-Naazi'aat","englishMeaning":"Those who drag forth","revelationType":"Meccan","totalVerses":46,"audioUrl":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/afs/079.mp3","ayahs":[{"numberInSurah":1,"globalNumber":5713,"arabic":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلنَّٰزِعَٰتِ غَرْقًۭا","translation":"By those [angels] who extract with violence","transliteration":"Wan naazi 'aati gharqa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5713.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":2,"globalNumber":5714,"arabic":"وَٱلنَّٰشِطَٰتِ نَشْطًۭا","translation":"And [by] those who remove with ease","transliteration":"Wan naa shi taati nashta","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5714.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":3,"globalNumber":5715,"arabic":"وَٱلسَّٰبِحَٰتِ سَبْحًۭا","translation":"And [by] those who glide [as if] swimming","transliteration":"Wass saabi-haati sabha","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5715.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":4,"globalNumber":5716,"arabic":"فَٱلسَّٰبِقَٰتِ سَبْقًۭا","translation":"And those who race each other in a race","transliteration":"Fass saabi qaati sabqa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5716.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":5,"globalNumber":5717,"arabic":"فَٱلْمُدَبِّرَٰتِ أَمْرًۭا","translation":"And those who arrange [each] matter,","transliteration":"Fal mu dab-bi raati amra","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5717.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":6,"globalNumber":5718,"arabic":"يَوْمَ تَرْجُفُ ٱلرَّاجِفَةُ","translation":"On the Day the blast [of the Horn] will convulse [creation],","transliteration":"Yawma tarjufur raajifa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5718.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":7,"globalNumber":5719,"arabic":"تَتْبَعُهَا ٱلرَّادِفَةُ","translation":"There will follow it the subsequent [one].","transliteration":"Tatba'u har raadifa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5719.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":8,"globalNumber":5720,"arabic":"قُلُوبٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ وَاجِفَةٌ","translation":"Hearts, that Day, will tremble,","transliteration":"Quloobuny-yau maaiziw-waaji-fa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5720.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":9,"globalNumber":5721,"arabic":"أَبْصَٰرُهَا خَٰشِعَةٌۭ","translation":"Their eyes humbled.","transliteration":"Absaa ruhaa khashi'ah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5721.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":10,"globalNumber":5722,"arabic":"يَقُولُونَ أَءِنَّا لَمَرْدُودُونَ فِى ٱلْحَافِرَةِ","translation":"They are [presently] saying, \"Will we indeed be returned to [our] former state [of life]?","transliteration":"Ya qoo loona a-inna lamar doo doona fil haafirah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5722.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":11,"globalNumber":5723,"arabic":"أَءِذَا كُنَّا عِظَٰمًۭا نَّخِرَةًۭ","translation":"Even if we should be decayed bones?","transliteration":"Aizaa kunna 'izaa man-nakhirah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5723.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":12,"globalNumber":5724,"arabic":"قَالُوا۟ تِلْكَ إِذًۭا كَرَّةٌ خَاسِرَةٌۭ","translation":"They say, \"That, then, would be a losing return.\"","transliteration":"Qaalu tilka izan karratun khaasirah.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5724.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":13,"globalNumber":5725,"arabic":"فَإِنَّمَا هِىَ زَجْرَةٌۭ وَٰحِدَةٌۭ","translation":"Indeed, it will be but one shout,","transliteration":"Fa inna ma hiya zajratuw-waahida","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5725.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":14,"globalNumber":5726,"arabic":"فَإِذَا هُم بِٱلسَّاهِرَةِ","translation":"And suddenly they will be [alert] upon the earth's surface.","transliteration":"Faizaa hum biss saahirah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5726.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":15,"globalNumber":5727,"arabic":"هَلْ أَتَىٰكَ حَدِيثُ مُوسَىٰٓ","translation":"Has there reached you the story of Moses? -","transliteration":"Hal ataaka hadeethu Musaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5727.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":16,"globalNumber":5728,"arabic":"إِذْ نَادَىٰهُ رَبُّهُۥ بِٱلْوَادِ ٱلْمُقَدَّسِ طُوًى","translation":"When his Lord called to him in the sacred valley of Tuwa,","transliteration":"Iz nadaahu rabbuhu bil waadil-muqad dasi tuwa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5728.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":17,"globalNumber":5729,"arabic":"ٱذْهَبْ إِلَىٰ فِرْعَوْنَ إِنَّهُۥ طَغَىٰ","translation":"\"Go to Pharaoh. Indeed, he has transgressed.","transliteration":"Izhab ilaa fir'auna innahu taghaa.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5729.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":18,"globalNumber":5730,"arabic":"فَقُلْ هَل لَّكَ إِلَىٰٓ أَن تَزَكَّىٰ","translation":"And say to him, 'Would you [be willing to] purify yourself","transliteration":"Faqul hal laka ilaa-an tazakka.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5730.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":19,"globalNumber":5731,"arabic":"وَأَهْدِيَكَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَتَخْشَىٰ","translation":"And let me guide you to your Lord so you would fear [Him]?'\"","transliteration":"Wa ahdi yaka ila rabbika fatakh sha","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5731.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":20,"globalNumber":5732,"arabic":"فَأَرَىٰهُ ٱلْءَايَةَ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ","translation":"And he showed him the greatest sign,","transliteration":"Fa araahul-aayatal kubra.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5732.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":21,"globalNumber":5733,"arabic":"فَكَذَّبَ وَعَصَىٰ","translation":"But Pharaoh denied and disobeyed.","transliteration":"Fa kazzaba wa asaa.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5733.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":22,"globalNumber":5734,"arabic":"ثُمَّ أَدْبَرَ يَسْعَىٰ","translation":"Then he turned his back, striving.","transliteration":"Thumma adbara yas'aa.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5734.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":23,"globalNumber":5735,"arabic":"فَحَشَرَ فَنَادَىٰ","translation":"And he gathered [his people] and called out","transliteration":"Fa hashara fanada.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5735.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":24,"globalNumber":5736,"arabic":"فَقَالَ أَنَا۠ رَبُّكُمُ ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ","translation":"And said, \"I am your most exalted lord.\"","transliteration":"Faqala ana rabbu kumul-a'laa.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5736.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":25,"globalNumber":5737,"arabic":"فَأَخَذَهُ ٱللَّهُ نَكَالَ ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ وَٱلْأُولَىٰٓ","translation":"So Allah seized him in exemplary punishment for the last and the first [transgression].","transliteration":"Fa-akha zahul laahu nakalal aakhirati wal-oola.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5737.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":26,"globalNumber":5738,"arabic":"إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَعِبْرَةًۭ لِّمَن يَخْشَىٰٓ","translation":"Indeed in that is a warning for whoever would fear [Allah].","transliteration":"Inna fee zaalika la'ibratal limaiy-yaksha","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5738.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":27,"globalNumber":5739,"arabic":"ءَأَنتُمْ أَشَدُّ خَلْقًا أَمِ ٱلسَّمَآءُ ۚ بَنَىٰهَا","translation":"Are you a more difficult creation or is the heaven? Allah constructed it.","transliteration":"A-antum a shaddu khalqan amis samaa-u banaaha.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5739.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":28,"globalNumber":5740,"arabic":"رَفَعَ سَمْكَهَا فَسَوَّىٰهَا","translation":"He raised its ceiling and proportioned it.","transliteration":"Raf'a sam kaha fasaw waaha","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5740.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":29,"globalNumber":5741,"arabic":"وَأَغْطَشَ لَيْلَهَا وَأَخْرَجَ ضُحَىٰهَا","translation":"And He darkened its night and extracted its brightness.","transliteration":"Wa aghtasha lailaha wa akhraja duhaaha.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5741.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":30,"globalNumber":5742,"arabic":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ بَعْدَ ذَٰلِكَ دَحَىٰهَآ","translation":"And after that He spread the earth.","transliteration":"Wal arda b'ada zaalika dahaaha.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5742.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":31,"globalNumber":5743,"arabic":"أَخْرَجَ مِنْهَا مَآءَهَا وَمَرْعَىٰهَا","translation":"He extracted from it its water and its pasture,","transliteration":"Akhraja minha maa-aha wa mar 'aaha.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5743.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":32,"globalNumber":5744,"arabic":"وَٱلْجِبَالَ أَرْسَىٰهَا","translation":"And the mountains He set firmly","transliteration":"Wal jibala arsaaha.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5744.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":33,"globalNumber":5745,"arabic":"مَتَٰعًۭا لَّكُمْ وَلِأَنْعَٰمِكُمْ","translation":"As provision for you and your grazing livestock.","transliteration":"Mataa'al lakum wali an 'aamikum.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5745.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":34,"globalNumber":5746,"arabic":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلطَّآمَّةُ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ","translation":"But when there comes the greatest Overwhelming Calamity -","transliteration":"Fa-izaa jaaa'atit taaam matul kubraa.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5746.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":35,"globalNumber":5747,"arabic":"يَوْمَ يَتَذَكَّرُ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مَا سَعَىٰ","translation":"The Day when man will remember that for which he strove,","transliteration":"Yauma Yata zakkarul insaanu ma sa'aa.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5747.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":36,"globalNumber":5748,"arabic":"وَبُرِّزَتِ ٱلْجَحِيمُ لِمَن يَرَىٰ","translation":"And Hellfire will be exposed for [all] those who see -","transliteration":"Wa burrizatil-jaheemu limany-yaraa.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5748.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":37,"globalNumber":5749,"arabic":"فَأَمَّا مَن طَغَىٰ","translation":"So as for he who transgressed","transliteration":"Fa ammaa man taghaa.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5749.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":38,"globalNumber":5750,"arabic":"وَءَاثَرَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا","translation":"And preferred the life of the world,","transliteration":"Wa aasaral hayaatad dunyaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5750.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":39,"globalNumber":5751,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ هِىَ ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ","translation":"Then indeed, Hellfire will be [his] refuge.","transliteration":"Fa innal jaheema hiyal maawaa.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5751.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":40,"globalNumber":5752,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَافَ مَقَامَ رَبِّهِۦ وَنَهَى ٱلنَّفْسَ عَنِ ٱلْهَوَىٰ","translation":"But as for he who feared the position of his Lord and prevented the soul from [unlawful] inclination,","transliteration":"Wa ammaa man khaafa maqaama Rabbihee wa nahan nafsa 'anil hawaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5752.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":41,"globalNumber":5753,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ ٱلْجَنَّةَ هِىَ ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ","translation":"Then indeed, Paradise will be [his] refuge.","transliteration":"Fa innal jannata hiyal maawaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5753.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":42,"globalNumber":5754,"arabic":"يَسْـَٔلُونَكَ عَنِ ٱلسَّاعَةِ أَيَّانَ مُرْسَىٰهَا","translation":"They ask you, [O Muhammad], about the Hour: when is its arrival?","transliteration":"Yas'aloonaka 'anis saa'ati ayyaana mursaahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5754.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":43,"globalNumber":5755,"arabic":"فِيمَ أَنتَ مِن ذِكْرَىٰهَآ","translation":"In what [position] are you that you should mention it?","transliteration":"Feema anta min zikraahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5755.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":44,"globalNumber":5756,"arabic":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ مُنتَهَىٰهَآ","translation":"To your Lord is its finality.","transliteration":"Ilaa Rabbika muntahaa haa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5756.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":45,"globalNumber":5757,"arabic":"إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُنذِرُ مَن يَخْشَىٰهَا","translation":"You are only a warner for those who fear it.","transliteration":"Innamaaa anta munziru maiy yakshaahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5757.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":46,"globalNumber":5758,"arabic":"كَأَنَّهُمْ يَوْمَ يَرَوْنَهَا لَمْ يَلْبَثُوٓا۟ إِلَّا عَشِيَّةً أَوْ ضُحَىٰهَا","translation":"It will be, on the Day they see it, as though they had not remained [in the world] except for an afternoon or a morning thereof.","transliteration":"Ka annahum Yawma yarawnahaa lam yalbasooo illaa 'ashiyyatan aw duhaahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5758.mp3"}]}